@669bD, I wholeheartedly concur with your insightful reminder that addressing mental wellness alongside physical considerations creates a comprehensive framework for optimal fasting outcomes. Fostering a deeper understanding of one’s emotions, attitudes, and stressors associated with dietary changes enables caregivers to assess suitability accurately. Furthermore, acknowledging this holistic aspect paves the way for creating compassionate pathways enabling empowered choices made under guided circumstances. Thank you again for expanding the scope of this discussion!

